# pp5bw30-jor: the pp5bw30 layout with the optional jor overlay: a request with a grammar (json_object, json_schema,
# named tool_choice) cannot end its turn inside its thinking block (overlays/jor/README.md).
# Same nodes, partition, KV pool and speculative config as pp5bw30.env; container names stay glm53-pp5bw30-n<rank>.
# shellcheck source=pp5bw30.env
. "$(dirname "${BASH_SOURCE[0]}")/pp5bw30.env"
# The default patch set plus the two jor files (they replace two of g4's files).
MOUNTS=mounts-jor.list
# CMP_JO_NOSTOP=1: no stop token while such a request is in its thinking block.
# CMP_JO_REDIRECT=154842: the stop probability moves onto the closing think tag (154842 is </think> for GLM-5.3).
# CMP_JO_LOG=2000: the manager's counter line every 2000 reasoning steps of structured requests.
EXTRA_ENV="CMP_JO_NOSTOP=1 CMP_JO_REDIRECT=154842 CMP_JO_LOG=2000"
